            <h3 class="luxury-font">Renovation</h3>
            <p>Want to upgrade your existing home? Our renovation services help modernize your space with minimal hassle.</p>
            <ul style="margin-top: 1rem; list-style-position: inside;">
                <li>Bathroom Remodeling</li>
                <li>Room Extensions</li>
                <li>Structural Repairs</li>
